    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Interview an AI Auditor\r\n\r\nMeet Maya — an AI simulation of an AI auditor whose job is to investigate whether AI systems work fairly and as claimed for the people who use them. Before you start your own testing work in this unit, interview Maya to find out what her job involves.\r\n\r\n1. Ask Maya at least three of these questions:\r\n\r\n   - What does a typical day look like for you?\r\n\r\n   - What does \"testing AI\" actually look like on the job?\r\n\r\n   - What made you want to do this kind of work?\r\n\r\n   - What's something about your job that most people wouldn't expect?\r\n\r\n3. Ask at least one question of your own.\r\n\r\n**Note:** Maya is an AI simulation, not a real person. Part of your job as a tester: notice where the simulation feels accurate and where it falls short.",
    "offer_browser_tts": "true",
